1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:10,452
The Guardian published analysis arguing that the US-China trade fight is not settled, even though direct American imports from China have fallen.

2
00:00:10,402 --> 00:00:17,638
It says some goods are moving through other countries, while a weak yuan keeps Chinese exports competitive.

3
00:00:17,638 --> 00:00:24,917
The debate matters for Europe too, because trade pressure often shifts across global supply chains.

